{
  "info": {
    "name": "HRMS \u00b7 Onboarding",
    "description": "Pipeline, new hire, hire detail, Microsoft 365, employee portal and ESS onboarding. Select the \"HRMS Onboarding\" environment. Run \"GET /onboarding/hires\" first: it stores hireId. HR calls send X-Dev-User ({{devUser}}); portal calls send X-Onboarding-Token ({{portalToken}}).",
